          "text": "Témoignages: MONCEAUX-SUR-DORDOGNE (19) 22.05.2010",
          "text_sha256": "562492a4e4f1f1cde911d6955f279068d1208c87541f3dbe16e9daef016d20a0"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
